es":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"PBbhDFJdUS7ebuRa1ggjaQ","review_id":"0f38ZnJqg-Y5v9x2XQ73GQ","date":"2015-11-01T17:43:36","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9298080205917358,"text_excerpt":"I went here because I was starving this morning and was in the area. This is a small, unassuming, and laid back place with tons of character and really cool 'pan art' (painted frying pans) on the walls. I recommend the eggs benedict, they really do this classic justice and I love that they serve it on french bread. The eggs were poached perfectly and the hollandaise was on point, the dish was exactly what I think of when I think of eggs benedict (except the french bread, but like I said, I liked that twist). I have been to restaurants that charge a lot more and purport to be higher caliber that have disappointed me with their eggs benedict. This place is about going back to the basics but..."},{"business_id":"PBbhDFJdUS7ebuRa1ggjaQ","review_id":"acGSyqtGWxrWAB9qY7gJaA","date":"2019-03-25T22:59:10","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9267808794975281,"text_excerpt":"I really like this Cafe even though I don't come here too often. This time I came here with friends for a Sunday brunch. It is such a great idea they serve breakfast all day long. It is very needed for me especially on Sundays when I go to work early and don't have time and appetite for a serious breakfast. I ordered a shrimp omelette, which came with hash browns (you can chose grits instead) and 2 slices of bread. Everything was delicious! The owner came to us to talk us asking if we live in the neighborhood and how often we come to the restaurant. All staff was extremely friendly. There is a small parking lot by the restaurant, but parking is not a problem at all. It is Downtown Gentill..."},{"business_id":"PBbhDFJdUS7ebuRa1ggjaQ","review_id":"9iU1_Qnd7L0lNicFvbVZRQ","date":"2018-05-30T03:00:05","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.924333930015564,"text_excerpt":"Really love the homie vibes this place gives. Large portions and just all around good simple breakfast! I do miss when they did Benedicts though! Have not have a bad experience here."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"PBbhDFJdUS7ebuRa1ggjaQ","photo_id":"s7OPLDsDxtvNHPeQqeXi1g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/s7OPLDsDxtvNHPeQqeXi1g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9999999403953552}]},"notebook_case":null}
